        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>High Security Rim Cylinder with Vertical Tail Piece</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese rim cylinders are used with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Hardware</b></a>.  Can be used with hardware that use a rim cylinder with a vertical tail piece (tail piece is in a vertical position). *Please note the dimension of the 2 rear mounting screw holes shown below. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/206S-RIM1VT_size.gif?v=1704354554\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"MUL-T-LOCK High Security Rim Cylinder with Vertical Tail\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSupplied standard with 1 owner key card and 2 keys per cylinder. Available in 7 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Mul-T-Lock 206SP-RIM1VT Rim Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Supplied with Flat Ring</li>\r\n<li>Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>MUL-T-LOCK's cylindrical locks are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Saves time and money on future lock replacements or re-keying when employes leave.  Remove the worry about anyone make duplicates of your keys. <b>Keep your doors safe!</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf ordering multiple locks you can have them Key Alike (use the same key) or Keyed Different (different keys for each lock). You can also order <a href=\"/products/cut-keys-for-mul-t-lock-locksets-and-padlocks\">Extra Keys Cut</a> below if more than 2 are required.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "High Security Rim Cylinder with Vertical Tail Piece, Mul-T-Lock 206S-RIM1VT-xx",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock high security grade 1 restricted key rim cylinder lock with vertical tail piece. Rim cylinders are used with panic device hardware.",
                "keywords": "MTL-206SP-RIM1VT-xx High Security Rim Cylinders, Security rim Locks, rim locks, Bump Proof locks, rim cylinder locks, security door locks, panic device locks, rim panic hardware, MTL-206SP-RIM1VT MUL-T-LOCK RIM CYLINDERS,"
            },
